    "innovation": "This paper introduces the \"responsibility-power disconnect\" concept through a mixed-methods, intersectional analysis, revealing how structural inequalities drive food insecurity among pastoralist women in Ethiopia who bear the greatest adaptation burdens but wield the least decision-making power.",
